{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>WonderMath 把數學練習的主導權交回家長手上，運算類型、數字範圍與練習內容全部由你決定，而非交由演算法安排。孩子在戴上眼鏡的青蛙導師 Bob 陪伴下，於色彩豐富的環境中練習加減乘除，答對時獲得鼓勵，遇上難題時由 Bob 逐步引導。程式原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，適合希望掌握子女學習進度的小學生家長。</p>\n\n<h2>家長自訂數學練習範圍</h2>\n<p>內置 21 個按技能及難度分類的練習範本，涵蓋加法、乘數表與混合運算，也可自行建立測試。家長能指定運算類型與數字範圍，並藉精通分數瞭解各項運算的強弱，測試紀錄會自動保存。程式沒有任何橫幅或影片廣告，亦不會向孩子顯示推銷內容，資料經 iCloud 在 Apple 裝置之間同步。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-12-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-13-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-14-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-15-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-16-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-17-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：WonderMath – Math Fact Fluency</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T06:18:29.754500+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":375,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}